A '''prayer enhance (+)''' is a potion made and used within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Each dose gradually restores the player's [[Prayer points]] for 290 seconds (4 minutes and 50 seconds). At level 82 or higher [[Prayer]], it restores one Prayer point every 6 [[game tick]]s.

The potion is made at level 78 [[Herblore]] by using a [[buchu leaf]] on a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while carrying a [[cicely]] in the inventory. This produces a four-dose potion and grants 26.5 Herblore experience.

It is the strongest variant of the prayer enhance potions, alongside the standard [[prayer enhance]] and the weaker [[prayer enhance (-)]]. Like the other variants, it cannot be taken outside the Chambers of Xeric.

