==Effects==
Both the total amount of times the restoration effect will trigger, as well as the duration of the interval between activations, scale with the player's Prayer level.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1622125423218888704|date=5 February 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/107222|archivedate=5 February 2023|quote=[Hey @JagexAsh how are the prayer enhance formulas calculated? So far I've found for the ticks to regen 1 prayer point it's been anywhere from 13t (11 prayer) to 6t (99 prayer). Amount of times it regens seems to be floor((level/2) + 31), but I could be wrong on that. Thanks!] I think you're right for the number of times it'll regen, for a strong one. The number of ticks between them is 500 divided by that number, or 63, whichever is lower.}} First, the total number of activations is determined by the formula:

<math>\mathit{activation}_\mathrm{amount} = \lfloor \frac{\text{Prayer level}}{2}+31 \rfloor</math>

Then, the amount of ticks between each point of restoration is determined by the formula:

<math>\mathit{activation}_\mathrm{interval} = \lfloor \frac{500}{\mathit{activation}_\mathrm{amount}} \rfloor</math>

